{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "288c42eb-a005-8ec3-9d0f-112af8c501af",
  "created_at": "2026-01-16T13:36:08-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Donna Ricci",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:32:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you this afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:32:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Um. Yes. I have a noise problem. [pause] Outside my place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:32:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm sorry to hear that. Let me get some details down. What kind of noise is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:33:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Motorcycles. [pause] A group of them. They sit out front. And rev. The engines. Every evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:33:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Every evening. Alright. And how long has this been happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:33:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since the weekend. [pause] Saturday, I think. Every night since. It's getting old."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:33:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Saturday through last night, so about six days now. Okay. Can you tell me where this is happening? I'll take the address nice and slow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:33:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. [pause] 230 Memorial Boulevard. Over by Easton's Beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:33:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "230 Memorial Boulevard. Did I get that right? Two, three, zero?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:33:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's it. [pause] I have a business there. They park right out front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:33:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. So it's in front of your business, and it's the evening hours. About what time does it usually start?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:33:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Around six. [pause] Sometimes earlier. Goes till... maybe nine. [pause] Customers notice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:34:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, six to about nine. That's helpful. Let me write that down. Give me one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:34:08-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Alright, I've got it. Is there anything else you can tell me about the group? Same bikes each night, or different ones?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the same. [pause] Five or six. I don't know them. [pause] They just. Rev. Over and over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:34:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I ask something? [pause] What are the quiet hours? In the city. So I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:34:35-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. In general, the city has quiet hours overnight, in the late evening into the early morning. I don't want to give you the wrong exact times from memory, so I'll have the police non-emergency line or the ordinance office confirm those. I can have someone call you back with the specifics."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:34:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. [pause] That would be good. Because nine isn't. Late. Maybe. [pause] But it's loud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:35:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, and it can still be a nuisance even before the late hours. I'll note it as a repeated noise complaint at your address so it's on record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:35:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. [pause] You know. Last time I called. I got put on hold. For a long time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:35:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry about that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:35:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. This time. [pause] You picked up. Right away. I'm pleasantly surprised."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:35:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'm glad. Fridays can go either way. Now, can I confirm a callback number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:35:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. 401-555-0172."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:35:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0172. Let me read that back to be sure. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-seven-two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:35:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:35:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. I'll pass this along today, and if it keeps up this evening, you can also call the police non-emergency line so there's a report with a time on it. Does that sound okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:35:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. [pause] I'll do that. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:36:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Ricci. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-16T13:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
